"""
STEP 21.1 - COMPANY DISCOVERY / SCREENING DATA QUALITY
Version: 21.1.0

Standalone DQ layer for Step 21 Company Discovery / Screening.

Audits:
    1. Step/version compatibility
    2. Required artifact presence and schema
    3. Company-master configured-universe coverage
    4. One-row-per-CIK grain
    5. Identity integrity
    6. Allowed vocabulary
    7. Screening eligibility determinism
    8. Boolean filter determinism
    9. Step 16 reconciliation
   10. Step 20 reconciliation
   11. Step 20 signal integrity / universe coverage
   12. Financial score preservation / no new score
   13. No ranking creation
   14. SEC capital != valuation
   15. Valuation fabrication prevention
   16. Funding-stage inference prevention
   17. Investor-identity inference prevention
   18. Ownership inference prevention
   19. Summary reconciliation
   20. Lineage reconciliation
   21. Promotion gating

Fatal integrity failures BLOCK promotion.
Known source-coverage limitations remain controlled warnings.
"""

